        "label": "InverterControlState",
        "disabled": false,
        "info": "Inverter Control State - Read & Write\n\n4 Registers:\n- 160: Remote Lock (0x0000=unlocked, 0x0002=locked)\n- 180: Power Switch (0=off, 1=on, 2=off)\n- 181: Factory Reset (0=disabled, 1=enabled)\n- 183: Island Protection (0=disabled, 1=enabled)\n\nAll R/W"
